<h1>Milestone Reached! 🚀🎉</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>Great news! One of your shortened links has reached a new popularity milestone.</p>

<div class="stat-box" style="text-align: center;">
  <p class="stat-number">{{clicks}}</p>
  <p class="stat-label">Total Clicks</p>
</div>

<p>The following short link reached the <span class="highlight">{{milestone}} clicks</span> milestone:</p>

<div class="url-box">
  {{shortUrl}}
</div>

<p style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 4px; color: #6E6E80;">
  Short Code: <code style="color: #6E6E80;">{{shortCode}}</code>
</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}/analytics/{{shortCode}}" class="btn">View Live Analytics 📈</a>
</div>

<p>Keep sharing and tracking your links to hit the next milestone!</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>The QuickLink Team</p>
